<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - Belgian OLO exchange totals 1.930 bln Bfr.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Belgian OLO exchange totals 1.930 bln Bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its linear bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 1.930 billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p> OLOs offered		   amount of new OLOs sold (in bln bfr)</p>
<p> code 287 4.00% (2000)	 1.680 *</p>
<p> code 259 8.75% (2002)	 0.250 *</p>
<p> code 273 6.50% (2005)	 0.000</p>
<p> code 268 7.50% (2008)	 0.000</p>
<p>NOTE - * in exchange for 1.930 bln bfr of OLO 254, 9.25 pct 1997. OLO 248 9.25 pct 1998 also exchangeable but no bids offered/accepted.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
